 discover -s tests -v` for engine implementation tests.
+
+### Browser preview media
+
+`game.sim.json` may declare `display.image_rendering` as `auto` for illustrated
+UI (default: `pixelated`), and `audio.clips` as a mapping from clip identifiers to
+project-relative WAV paths. Optional boolean `audio_muted` metadata gates playback, stops active voices and clears pending events; absent metadata preserves normal playback. The native Host module can append `audio_events` to
+its existing state JSON: `{ "seq": 1, "clip": "hit", "volume": 0.8 }` entries
+with increasing sequence numbers. The browser deduplicates events, unlocks Web
+Audio from the first game pointer/key gesture, and provides a mute button. Only
+manifest-declared project-local WAV files are served. These optional fields do
+not change Host ABI v1 or implement game logic in the browser. Restart the preview
+server after changing browser media settings.
+
+`Mosaico2DDrawAlphaMask` draws a borrowed A8 mask at native size, honoring the 2D
+clip. It enables build-time glyph subsets without an RGB texture or runtime font
+library. RGB565 alpha blending interpolates each color channel independently.
